      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "The Bachelor of Arts in Liberal Arts is a fully online program offering a broad multidisciplinary approach to earning a higher education degree. Students are exposed to courses across various areas of study at Chico State. Student must choose four courses from four domains. The four domains are: Domain 1: Technology, Literature, and the Arts (Group 1) Domain 2: History, Society, and Power Domain 3: Food, Health, and the Environment (Group 2) Domain 4: Social Welfare, Human Development, and Community The two domains with lower division courses are Domain 1: Technology, Literature, and the Arts and Domain 3: Food, Health, and the Environment. All other courses for this requirement are at the upper division level. See the University Catalog for the full listing of degree requirements.",
